config SYNCHROFLY_BLOCK_SCHEDULER_WARMUP_MS
	int "Warmup duration for scheduler in milliseconds"
	default 10000
	help
	  Warmup duration in milliseconds. During warmup, only sync blocks
	  (Glossy or Butler) run to bootstrap the network. All nodes transition
	  to normal superframe execution at the same reference-time boundary.

config SYNCHROFLY_SUPERFRAME_MAX_SLOTS
	int "Maximum amount of slots contained in superframe"
	default 70
	help
           This setting specifies the amount of slots contained in the superframe.
           A slot may contain a block for execution.